Aim:Develop a simple containerized application using Docker.
1. Create a folder 
mkdir docker-html-program 
cd docker-html-program 
2. Create index.html 
nano index.html 
and write following html code in the file
<html>
<body> 
<h1>Hello Docker Demonstartion</h1>
<p>This is My first Docker containerized web application.</p> 
</body> 
</html>
Then Save and exit. 
3. Create Dockerfile nano Dockerfile and write 
FROM nginx COPY index.html /usr/share/nginx/html/ 
4. Build the Docker image 
docker build -t myhtml . 
5. Run the container 
docker run -d -p 8080:80 myhtml 
6. Open in browser And type http://localhost:8080 
You can see the output
Hello Docker Demonstartion! This is My first Docker containerized web application. 
